# Shared DVC settings. Deliberately NO remote and NO credentials here.
# Each environment adds its own remote, see docs/dvc-runbook.md:
#   local dev     : dvc remote add -d --local localstore <path>        (-> .dvc/config.local, git-ignored)
#   team (S3)     : dvc remote add -d storage s3://<bucket>/dvc        (once the bucket exists)
#   DagsHub       : dvc remote add dagshub s3://dvc  (see runbook)
# Credentials come from the AWS credential chain / DagsHub token env vars, never from this file.
